OL,5,
OL,6,FTyne and Wear Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Fsaid its teams, including rescue boats,
OL,8,Fwere also "assisting blue light
OL,9,Fcolleagues with the ongoing rescue
OL,10,Fefforts".
